; Export surface of the Explorer thumbnail provider (T05).
;
; Exactly two COM in-proc server entry points are exported, both PRIVATE so they
; cannot be linked against by accident. DllRegisterServer/DllUnregisterServer
; are deliberately absent: registration is installer-owned (ADR-0006/0007) and a
; self-registration export would bypass the non-clobber rules in
; docs/design/05-thumbnail-provider.md.
LIBRARY Preview3DThumbnailProvider
EXPORTS
    DllGetClassObject PRIVATE
    DllCanUnloadNow PRIVATE